                'content_blocks' => json_decode('[{"type": "html", "content": "<h2>Planning a Cloud Migration or Facility Consolidation</h2><p>Data center decommissioning is among the highest-risk projects in enterprise IT. Beyond moving physical chassis, engineers must orchestrate power phase-downs, cable mapping, cable deracking, and real-time asset reconciliation against Configuration Management Databases (CMDB).</p><h3>Crucial Phases for Risk-Free Decommissioning</h3><ul><li><strong>Discovery & Asset Audit:</strong> Pre-project barcode labeling and live-to-staged asset validation.</li><li><strong>Secure Network Isolation:</strong> Severing VLANs and verifying that backup clusters have resumed all active workloads.</li><li><strong>On-Site Data Erase or Degaussing:</strong> Wiping storage arrays prior to hardware leaving facility perimeters.</li><li><strong>Logistical Extraction:</strong> Custom anti-static crating, specialized server lifts, and bonded freight transit.</li></ul>"}]', true),
